# Preserve the bytes bound by diagnostic/failure manifests, including CRLF logs.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
**/stdout.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
**/stderr.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
